---
// The ATELIER TEXTILES wordmark, exported from the Figma design system
// (Logo, node 5319:2378 / 3392:42) and inlined rather than linked.
//
// Inlined for one reason: the mark is two-tone and only one tone is fixed.
// "ATELIER" is always the brand gold (--gold, #b5985b in the export);
// "TEXTILES" is ink on the paper header and bone on a photograph or the umber
// footer. An <img> cannot inherit that, so the ink paths carry
// `fill="currentColor"` and every caller just sets `color`.
//
// `width` is the drawn width in the mock: 150px in the header, 175.656px in
// the footer. The viewBox keeps the aspect ratio, so height follows.
const { width = '150px', class: className, label = 'Atelier Textiles' } = Astro.props
---

